            ja = {
                {"纱希的丈夫，是中村章一。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00040",
        linknext = "block_00042"
    },
    block_00042 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "他是中村家的下任当主，也是相当有权势的人物。一边经手各种产",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "业，一边还担任着这所学校的理事长。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00041",
        linknext = "block_00043"
    },
    block_00043 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"纱希能在那个年纪当上主任，正是托了这层关系的福。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00042",
        linknext = "block_00044"
    },
    block_00044 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"纱希的确是个能干的家伙，但光靠能干，可没法在这世上通行无阻。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00043",
        linknext = "block_00045"
    },
    block_00045 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"在这世间，比能干更管用的另有其物。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00044",
        linknext = "block_00046"
    },
    block_00046 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"纱希是怀着怎样的心情嫁入中村家的，我不得而知。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00045",
        linknext = "block_00047"
    },
    block_00047 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "只是听说，那桩婚事与本人的意愿无关，是以近乎政治联姻的形式",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "定下来的。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00046",
        linknext = "block_00048"
    },
    block_00048 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "比纱希年长１５岁。那副样貌，就算说客套话也称不上是风度翩翩",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "的银发绅士。我听到的是这样的传闻。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00047",
        linknext = "block_00049"
    },
    block_00049 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"除此之外，也听不到关于他的什么好名声。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00048",
        linknext = "block_00050"
    },
    block_00050 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "嘛，毕竟他是这所学校的经营者，被身为雇员的教师们在背后说闲",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "话，要说没办法也确实没办法……。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00049",
        linknext = "block_00051"
    },
    block_00051 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"只是，他并非什么人格高尚之辈，这一点大概是确凿的。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00050",
        linknext = "block_00052"
    },
    block_00052 = {
        {"cgdel", id = -1},
        {"msgoff"},
        {"bg", file = "zbluesky_winter", id = 9, lv = 9, speed = 300000, sync = 1, path = ":cg/", x2 = 960, y2 = 0, x = -960, y = 0, ax = 1920, ay = 1080, bx = -960, by = -540},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"所以，尽管有失分寸，我还是会忍不住去想。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00051",
        linknext = "block_00053"
    },
    block_00053 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "走过婚礼的红毯，在那尽头，纱希是怀着怎样的心情，说出神前的",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "誓言的呢？"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00052",
        linknext = "block_00054"
    },
    block_00054 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"那我无从知晓。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00053",
        linknext = "block_00055"
    },
    block_00055 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"因为，我不曾见过她的新娘礼服。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00054",
        linknext = "block_00056"
    },
    block_00056 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"那段时间，我正在美国。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00055",
        linknext = "block_00057"
    },
    block_00057 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "在周游各国的途中，我尤其中意的是美国。我沿着东海岸缓缓北下，",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "已经在那里度过了将近一年。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00056",
        linknext = "block_00058"
    },
    block_00058 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"在马萨诸塞州东北部萨福克郡的那座巨大都市，我得知了她的结婚。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00057",
        linknext = "block_00059"
    },
    block_00059 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "读完她的来信，我在波士顿的酒馆里，和碰巧坐在邻座的外国人碰",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "了杯。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00058",
        linknext = "block_00060"
    },
    block_00060 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"至今我仍会想起。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00059",
        linknext = "block_00061"
    },
    block_00061 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"那时的我，道一声「干杯」去祝福，真的好吗？"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00060",
        linknext = "block_00062"
    },
    block_00062 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"还是说，诅咒一句「去死」才更好呢？"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00061",
        linknext = "block_00063"
    },
    block_00063 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "身在地球另一端的我，不知道哪一个才是正确的，只对眼前的外国",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "人说了句「来干杯吧！」。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00062",
        linknext = "block_00064"
    },
    block_00064 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "外国人说「不赚钱的事我不干」，我便回道「那从今往后，也试着",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "干干不赚钱的事吧！」。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00063",
        linknext = "block_00065"
    },
    block_00065 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"外国人苦笑着骂了句「混账东西」，倾杯而尽。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00064",
        linknext = "block_00066"
    },
    block_00066 = {
        {"cgdel", id = -1},
        {"msgoff"},
        {"bg", file = "black", path = ":bg/", sync = 0},
        {"fg", ch = "フリッドマン", size = "z1", mode = 3, resize = 1, path = ":fg/fri/z1/", file = "fri_z1b0000", face = "b0001", head = "fri_z1b", lv = 4, id = 9, sync = 0},
        {"bg", file = "reco", id = 9, lv = 9, path = ":sys/", sync = 0},
        {"extrans", time = 500},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"弗里德曼这个男子人，从以前开始就让人捉摸不透。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00065",
        linknext = "block_00067"
    },
    block_00067 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "从马萨诸塞的名门大学毕业后（话虽如此，是在日本不太为人所知",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "的Ｕｍａｓｓ），投身金融界，之后不知为何进了穆尔财团。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00066",
        linknext = "block_00068"
    },
    block_00068 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "他的专业似乎并非美术（毕竟本来就是干金融的），却从当时起就",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "有着可怕的美术鉴定眼力。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00067",
        linknext = "block_00069"
    },
    block_00069 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "不愧是金融界出身的人，口头禅是「钱」，可尽管如此，不赚钱的",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "事他也没少干。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00068",
        linknext = "block_00070"
    },
    block_00070 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"态度恶劣，还有性格也不怎么样，不过大概本性还是个好人吧。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00069",
        linknext = "block_00071"
    },
    block_00071 = {
        {"cgdel", id = -1},
        {"msgoff"},
        {"bg", file = "bluesky_winter", id = 9, lv = 9, sync = 1, path = ":cg/"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"与那家伙干杯的玻璃杯声，响亮得仿佛能传到地球的另一端。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00070",
        linknext = "block_00072"
    },
    block_00072 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"简直让人觉得，那是能抵达世界尽头的音色。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00071",
        linknext = "block_00073"
    },
    block_00073 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"不过，那多半只是烂醉罢了。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00072",
        linknext = "block_00074"
    },
    block_00074 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"我在地球的另一端，以干杯的形式祝福了纱希的婚姻。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00073",
        linknext = "block_00075"
    },
    block_00075 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"话说回来，那时结识的弗里德曼，此后与我结下了漫长的交情。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00074",
        linknext = "block_00076"
    },
    block_00076 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "那家伙和我数度成为生意伙伴，又数度反目为敌。弗里德曼和我，",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "一直都是那样的关系。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00075",
        linknext = "block_00077"
    },
    block_00077 = {
        {"bgm", stop = 1, time = 1000},
        {"cgdel", id = -1},
        {"msgoff"},
        {"bg", file = "bg046a", path = ":bg/", ax = 960, ay = 563, bx = 0, by = -23, sync = 0},
        {"fg", ch = "紗希", size = "z1", mode = 3, path = ":fg/sak/z1/", file = "sak_z1d0000", face = "d0008", head = "sak_z1d", lv = 4, id = 9, sync = 0},
